Licensing by component
======================

The project-authored scripts, mappings, templates, manifests, documentation,
and rendered theme ports are licensed under the MIT License in
LICENSES/MIT.txt unless a file states otherwise.

The palette data in palettes/ comes from the Modus themes palettes published
under CC0-1.0. The CC0 legal text is in LICENSES/CC0-1.0.txt and the source is
https://protesilaos.com/emacs/modus-themes-colors.

The vendored files in vendor/modus-themes retain their upstream licenses and
copyright notices. In particular, the Emacs Lisp implementation is licensed
under GPL-3.0-or-later as described in vendor/modus-themes/COPYING, while the
manual is licensed under GFDL-1.3-or-later under the notice embedded in
vendor/modus-themes/doc/modus-themes.org.

Where a more specific file-level notice conflicts with this summary, the
file-level notice controls.
